  "description": "DNG Lettings are delighted to present this well-located two-bedroom top-floor apartment at Top Flat, 86 Palmerston Road, Dublin 6. Ideally positioned in one of Dublin 6’s most established and sought-after residential areas, this property offers well-proportioned accommodation combined with an excellent location and easy access to a wide range of local amenities and transport links.\n\nThe accommodation comprises two bedrooms, a main bathroom and a well-proportioned living area, providing a practical and comfortable layout for modern living. Being positioned on the top floor also offers a pleasant sense of privacy, while the property’s layout provides a good balance between living and bedroom accommodation.\n\nThe location is a particular highlight, with Palmerston Road situated within easy reach of Rathmines, Ranelagh and Rathgar. The surrounding area offers an excellent selection of cafés, restaurants, bars, independent shops and everyday conveniences, making it easy to enjoy everything the area has to offer. Rathmines Village is nearby, with a wide variety of retail, dining and leisure facilities, while Ranelagh is also within convenient reach and is renowned for its vibrant village atmosphere and excellent selection of restaurants and cafés.\n\nFor anyone travelling into the city, the property is exceptionally well connected. There are numerous Dublin Bus routes operating in the surrounding area, providing convenient access to Dublin city centre and other parts of the city. The Luas Green Line is also within easy reach, offering a further convenient transport option for commuters and providing connections towards the city centre and beyond.\n\nThe property is also ideally positioned for access to a number of Dublin’s well-established parks and recreational amenities. Palmerston Park, Bushy Park and the extensive grounds of Herbert Park are all within easy reach, providing excellent opportunities for walking, running and enjoying the outdoors. The area is also well served by a variety of sporting and recreational facilities.\n\nDublin 6 is a highly regarded residential location, popular for its combination of excellent amenities, established neighbourhoods and convenient access to Dublin city centre. The property is also within easy reach of a number of schools and third-level institutions, further adding to the appeal of the location.\n\nWhether travelling into the city centre, enjoying the cafés and restaurants of Rathmines and Ranelagh or taking advantage of the surrounding parks and amenities, this property offers the opportunity to live in a well-connected and highly convenient part of Dublin 6.\n\n**Photos may be enhanced using AI for advertising purposes.** ",
